# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CodeZero Frontend — Environment Template
# Copy to `.env` for local overrides. Never commit `.env` or real secrets.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# API (optional in dev)
# Dev: leave empty — Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:2026 (restart dev server after edits).
# Production build: set your public API origin only (no credentials).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OAuth — public client identifiers only (NOT client secrets)
# Secrets belong on the backend. Never paste client secrets into this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google Identity Services — OAuth 2.0 client ID (Web application)
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# GitHub OAuth App — client ID (dev may use *_LOCAL override)
# VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID_LOCAL=

# GitHub callback must match the OAuth App "Authorization callback URL" exactly.
# Dev: auto-derived from browser origin + /auth/github/callback
# Prod example (replace host with your deployment):
# VITE_GITHUB_REDIRECT_URI=https://your-domain.example/auth/github/callback
# VITE_GITHUB_REDIRECT_URI_LOCAL=http://localhost:5173/auth/github/callback
